    <item>
      <title>Inaugural David Blackwell Distinguished Lecture Series- Provost Lecture Honoring David Blackwell at Howard University Blackburn Center</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54497481231919/huge/c11c98b76dd94094e2c5353b651502cec423127e.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Tue, 17 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>The Inaugural David Blackwell Distinguished Lecture Series 2026, celebrates the extraordinary legacy of Dr. David Blackwell and the expanding frontiers of mathematics, data science, and artificial intelligence. This inaugural program will bring together the Howard University community to honor Blackwell’s pioneering contributions while exploring the ideas, innovations, and emerging opportunities shaping these fields today. Join us for an inspiring conversation connecting Blackwell’s enduring legacy with the future of mathematics, data science, and AI.
<br> </p>

<p>Featured Speaker: Dr. Nandi Leslie is a Howard University Trustee, distinguished Mathematics alumna, and recipient of the 2026 SIAM Industry Prize. As the inaugural distinguished lecturer, she brings a unique perspective at the intersection of mathematical excellence, innovation, and real-world impact.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Event Details
<br>📅 Date: Tuesday, November 17, 2026
<br>🕙 Time: 10 am - 5 pm
<br>📍 Venue: Blackburn University Center, Howard University, Washington, DC</p>

<p>🔗 REGISTER HERE</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Organized by: Department of Mathematics with B. S. in Data Science, Howard University, the Department of Economics, the Center for an Equitable Economy and Sustainable Society (e²s²) and the Center for Applied Data Science and Analytics (CADSA).</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Questions? Contact Dr. Omari Swinton at <a href="mailto:oswinton@howard.edu">oswinton@howard.edu</a>.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>For more about Dr. David Blackwell, see The Dig's article on his enduring legacy.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/David-Blackwell-Distinguished-Lecture-Series">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A Inaugural David Blackwell Distinguished Lecture Series- Provost Lecture Honoring David Blackwell&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Nov 17%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AThe Inaugural David Blackwell Distinguished Lecture Series 2026%2C celebrates the extraordinary legacy of Dr. David Blackwell and the expanding frontiers of mathematics%2C data science%2C and artificial intelligence. This inaugural program will bring together the Howard University community to honor Blackwell%E2%80%99s pioneering contributions while exploring the ideas%2C innovations%2C and emerging opportunities shaping these fields today. Join us for an inspiring conversation connecting Blackwell%E2%80%99s enduring legacy with the future of mathematics%2C data science%2C and AI.%0A %0A%0AFeatured Speaker%3A Dr. Nandi Leslie is a Howard University Trustee%2C distinguished Mathematics alumna%2C and recipient of the 2026 SIAM Industry Prize. As the inaugural distinguished lecturer%2C she brings a unique perspective at the intersection of mathematical excellence%2C innovation%2C and real-world impact.%0A%0A %0A%0AEvent Details%0A%F0%9F%93%85 Date%3A Tuesday%2C November 17%2C 2026%0A%F0%9F%95%99 Time%3A 10 am - 5 pm%0A%F0%9F%93%8D Venue%3A Blackburn University Center%2C Howard University%2C Washington%2C DC%0A%0A%F0%9F%94%97 REGISTER HERE%0A%0A %0A%0AOrganized by%3A Department of Mathematics with B. S. in Data Science%2C Howard University%2C the Department of Economics%2C the Center for an Equitable Economy and Sustainable Society %28e%C2%B2s%C2%B2%29 and the Center for Applied Data Science and Analytics %28CADSA%29.%0A%0A %0A%0AQuestions%3F Contact Dr. Omari Swinton at oswinton%40howard.edu.%0A%0A %0A%0AFor more about Dr. David Blackwell%2C see The Dig%27s article on his enduring legacy.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%