    <item>
      <title>Successful Conflict Conversations</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54250545564686/huge/cad7b3894691954012672bd6d7c080c2ede58797.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Tue, 17 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Howard's Successful Conflict Conversations (SCC) training equips employees with practical skills and strategies to confidently navigate workplace conflict. Participants will learn how to engage in productive, respectful conversations that strengthen communication, address interpersonal challenges early, and support a more collaborative and professional work environment. SCC provides employees with actionable tools to resolve conflict constructively before it escalates and impacts working relationships or team effectiveness.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Register Here: <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/howard/learning/course/e18b1464612610015f0420931d630001?type=9882927d138b100019b6a2df1a46018b">https://www.myworkday.com/howard/learning/course/e18b1464612610015f0420931d630001?type=9882927d138b100019b6a2df1a46018b</a></p>

